    It could be that your syntax forces the factors to be standardized, so that cov.lv <http://cov.lv> and cor.lv <http://cor.lv> are the same.  The more usual default leaves factor variances free, but that default can be overridden by syntax. Unexpected results are usually a bad sign, but the problem may be just a typo somewhere.  Can we see your syntax?
--Ed Rigdon

